      "title": "Triage: Intermittent Service Issues and Data Mismatches",
      "content_summary": "Guidance for handling tickets with inconsistent behavior across browsers or data mismatches where the root cause is initially unclear.",
      "content_body": "When reports indicate intermittent unresponsiveness or data discrepancies without a reproducible path, first verify the customer's browser versions and any unsupported configurations. Request HAR files and specific timestamps for failed requests to isolate network or client-side anomalies. If logs remain inconclusive, document the inability to reproduce the issue and close the ticket as a duplicate if similar cases exist. Educate the customer on supported browser matrices to prevent future invalid reports."
